          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "一",
          "content": "<p>个比利时工程师写了一个程序，让 AR 眼镜<a href=\"https://www.tomshardware.com/maker-stem/engineer-creates-ad-block-for-the-real-world-with-augmented-reality-glasses-no-more-products-or-branding-in-your-everyday-life\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">实时识别路边广告</a>。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202506/bg2025062902.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>一旦发现广告区域，就在其上覆盖一个红色遮盖层，相当于视觉屏蔽广告。</p>\n<p>这是我看到的最有创意的 AR 用法。</p>",
